  an AI-Ready Skill|Online
DTSTART:20260826T190000Z
CATEGORIES:ai,frontend
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/0egsw9cf\n\nHo
 sted by Bill Raymond & The AI Collective
